  "slug": "customer-return-count-sheet-form",
  "title": "Customer Return Count Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "A practical reconciliation count sheet for customer return that connects identity, observations and evidence, decision authority, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original retail-operations reconciliation count sheet for customer return covering return decision and disposition, evidence references, authorization, escalation, operating limits, disposition, and handoff without copying a third-party form.",
  "use_case": "Use when a returns or service lead opens one customer return record to set the count basis, preserve expected and observed values, reconcile variances, authorize a result, and hand off unresolved lines; closure requires a documented outcome, evidence route, responsible owner, and recipient acknowledgment.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
